OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest showcases superb
OL,7,     Fperformances the UK and beyond,
OL,8,     Fincluding a live concert from
OL,9,     Fpianist Barry Douglas at Wigmore
OL,10,     FHall, featuring music by Brahms
OL,11,     Fand Mussorgsky.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Greatest
OL,13,G     Showstoppers
OL,14,     F1/4. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,15,     Flife and music of the 'Valkyrie of
OL,16,     Fthe Piano', Teresa Carreno.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FThomas Bowes and Eleanor Alberga
OL,19,     Fplay live from their new Elgar
OL,20,     Falbum. Kahchun Wong on conducting
OL,21,     Fthe Halle ahead of their concert
OL,22,     Fat Manchester's Bridgewater Hall.
