OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites, with music by
OL,9,     Fcomposers including JS Bach, Amy
OL,10,     FBeach and Thomas Ades.
OL,11,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,12,     FThe celebrated Canadian pianist
OL,13,     FAngela Hewitt plays fortepiano
OL,14,     Fwith the Dunedin Consort in two
OL,15,     Fcontrasting concertos by CPE Bach
OL,16,     Fand Mozart, plus Haydn's 6th
OL,17,     FSymphony, 'Le matin'.
OL,18,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,19,     FComposer and minimalism pioneer
OL,20,     FSteve Reich remembers the music of
OL,21,     Fjazz musician John Coltrane.
OL,22,     FPresented by Ashley Kahn.
